[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Defend Your Friend</h2>
<i>~y"Send Money Please !!!"~w<br>
--~B~E~mVarious Allies~.~w</i>
<p>One man cannot fight the furies alone, not even a 
man with a Super Island. On the way over to ask the 
assistance of your long time friend, the sweet Queen of 
Elements, one of your scout balloons arrives informing 
you that the Queen has been boxed in by a couple 
hooligans. Free the Queen so together you can crush 
the furies.


$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>The Queen Is Safe</h2>
<p>Thank goodness, you have saved the queen, now let the furies feel your combined power.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,three

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>I Cannot Defeat them Alone !!!</h2>
<p>The Queen's temple has caught fire, help her swiftly.

[ai2TempleDead]
<h2>I'm Done For...</h2>
<p>The Queen has lost her temple, she won't last much longer.

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>It's Been Swell</h2>
<p>The Queen has been captured, rescue her before "Its Too Late."

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Its Too Late</h2>
<p>The Queen has parished, now you will surely feel the furies wrath.

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>Chico Is Open !!!</h2>
<p>Infest his island and clean it up so that you may save the Queen.

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>What The ?!?!</h2>
<p>On the dead priest you find plans for another flying transport, and some technical specs for two barriers.
$Button=OK,Tell,GetChico

[GetChico]
<$GetTechnology,136>
<$GetTechnology,145>
<$GetTechnology,146>

[ai4TempleDead]
<h2>Guido Is Open !!!</h2>
<p>Infest his island and clean it up so that you may save the Queen.

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Sweet...</h2>
<p>Amoungst the bloodied robes of Guido you find the plans for more transports, and barriers.
$Button=OK,Tell,GetGuido

[GetGuido]
<$GetTechnology,149>
<$GetTechnology,141>
<$GetTechnology,137>

[Failed]
<h2>Now What ?</h2>
<p>The furies are sure to crush you for sure now, the only thing left to do is decide if you will take it head on, or run away forever.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
